OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused tells trial he was
OL,4,Acarrying knives
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager accused of murdering a
OL,7,F16-year-old told his trial he was
OL,8,Fcarrying two knives on the day the boy
OL,9,Fwas attacked, but denied using them to
OL,10,Fdeliver the fatal wound.
OL,12,FBaye Bireme Fall, known as BB, died
OL,13,Ffrom a single stab wound after a
OL,14,Fconfrontation near the Ortongate
OL,15,FShopping Centre in Peterborough on 12
OL,16,FApril.
OL,18,FEmidas Krutkevicius, 18, from Garton
OL,19,FEnd Road in the city, and a 15-year-old
OL,20,Fboy, who cannot be named because of his
OL,21,Fage, deny murder.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
